flowchart TB
accTitle: Reduce repeated work, then distribute eligible reads
accDescr: Read requests check a cache first, cache misses use read replicas, and writes remain on the primary which replicates asynchronously.
READ["Eligible profile read"] --> C{"Cache hit?"}
C -->|Yes| HIT["Return cached result"]
C -->|No| REPL[("Read replicas")]
REPL --> FILL["Return and cache result"]
WRITE["Write or immediate-consistency read"] --> P[("Primary database")]
P -.->|Asynchronous replication| REPL
class READ,WRITE inputData
class C decision
class REPL,P storage
class HIT,FILL output
